---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead
			title="About Michael Daum | Coobeeyon Development"
			description="Michael Daum is a hands-on software developer in Toronto who leads Coobeeyon Development, a small consulting practice for difficult product and engineering problems."
		/>
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />

		<main>
			<h1>About Coobeeyon Development</h1>

			<hr />

			<p>
				Coobeeyon Development Limited is my software consulting company. I am
				<b>Michael Daum</b>, a hands-on software developer based in Toronto,
				Ontario, Canada.
			</p>

			<p>
				I help smart, ambitious teams solve difficult product and engineering
				problems. My work ranges from geometry-rich browser interfaces and useful AI
				to integrations, data pipelines, and mature systems that need careful change.
			</p>

			<p>
				Coobeeyon is not a conventional agency and I am not trying to build a large
				standing team. I lead the work myself and bring in highly experienced people
				I trust when a project needs their skills.
			</p>

			<p>
				If that sounds like the right fit, <a href="mailto:mike.daum@coobeeyon.net"
					>send me a note</a
				>.
			</p>
		</main>

		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
